    "1. Tap Open Shortcuts below — a new shortcut opens.\n2. Add the “Open App” action and choose %1$@.\n3. Tap the title at the top, choose Rename, and paste (“%1$@” is copied — Copy name refreshes it).\n4. Come back and tap Test launch.\n\nSays the shortcut can’t be found? The names don’t match — rename it in Shortcuts, or tap Use a Shortcut instead to start over.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Tap Open Shortcuts below — a new shortcut opens.\n2. Add the “Open App” action and choose %1$@.\n3. Tap the title at the top, choose Rename, and paste (“%1$@” is copied — Copy name refreshes it).\n4. Come back and tap Test launch.\n\nSays the shortcut can’t be found? The names don’t match — rename it in Shortcuts, or tap Use a Shortcut instead to start over."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 点击下方“打开快捷指令”，会新建一个快捷指令。\n2. 添加“打开 App”操作并选择 %1$@。\n3. 点顶部标题，选择“重命名”，然后粘贴（“%1$@”已复制，可用“复制名称”重新复制）。\n4. 回来点击“测试启动”。\n\n提示找不到快捷指令？说明名称不一致——在快捷指令里改名，或再点“改用快捷指令”重来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 點按下方「打開捷徑」，會新增一個捷徑。\n2. 加入「打開 App」動作並選擇 %1$@。\n3. 點頂部標題，選擇「重新命名」，然後貼上（「%1$@」已複製，可用「複製名稱」重新複製）。\n4. 回來點按「測試啟動」。\n\n顯示找不到捷徑？表示名稱不一致——在捷徑裡改名，或再點「改用捷徑」重來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
